# Swagger + Testing Minimum Bar

## Swagger/OpenAPI

- Every service must expose Swagger.
- Controllers must include:
  - tags
  - request/response DTOs
  - examples
  - error responses (400/401/403/429/500)
  - BearerAuth where required
- Swagger must be accessible in QA (and optionally disabled in PROD).

## Testing

- Unit tests for core application services/use-cases.
- Integration or e2e tests for at least:
  - auth login
  - refresh rotation
  - forgot/reset password flow
- Tests must use real Postgres in CI via docker (or Testcontainers if configured).
- No mocking the whole world: keep one real DB integration test.
